{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/2ab43de4734aea0163f889647ea7fbd2.poster.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/2ab43de4734aea0163f889647ea7fbd2.webm?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/2ab43de4734aea0163f889647ea7fbd2.mp4?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i><strong>Tiny Hero Courier</strong> is a fast-paced action game set in a miniature <strong>tilt-shift</strong> world! Play as Rupert, a courier in a post-apocalyptic world, <strong>delivering packages</strong> while dodging zombies, solving puzzles, and navigating dynamic, visually stunning diorama-like environments.<br><br><strong>Tiny Hero Courier</strong> is inspired by miniature worlds, dioramas, and the <strong>&quot;Love, Death &amp; Robots&quot;</strong> episode <strong>&quot;Night of the Mini Dead.&quot;</strong> The game humorously portrays Rupert\u2019s adventures, showing how an ordinary courier\u2019s life can turn extraordinary as he becomes a true hero.</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/31255701daad5687af68a69affc105c2.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/d3548422981cdf3d9ab9af1b0bddc921.poster.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/d3548422981cdf3d9ab9af1b0bddc921.webm?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/d3548422981cdf3d9ab9af1b0bddc921.mp4?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Deliver packages of various sizes</strong>, each affecting movement speed and strategy. Special packages, like explosive <strong>TNT</strong> or <strong>fragile items</strong>, add unique gameplay challenges and require careful handling to avoid failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/4f1da80db0a2f63324f2c5dde5093454.poster.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/4f1da80db0a2f63324f2c5dde5093454.webm?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/4f1da80db0a2f63324f2c5dde5093454.mp4?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Players must <strong>hold a button</strong> to carry packages, creating tension and adding an extra layer of skill to the delivery process. <strong>Dropping a package</strong> comes with consequences, making each delivery feel impactful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/9b71ef05ff5d767a53897e4bafd8fc27.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/9e0f2f896d4091395b1e26774cbbae07.poster.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/9e0f2f896d4091395b1e26774cbbae07.webm?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/9e0f2f896d4091395b1e26774cbbae07.mp4?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rupert</strong> uses <strong>switches</strong> and <strong>mechanisms</strong> to solve puzzles, <strong>activate traps</strong>, and clear obstacles along his path. Every interaction brings him closer to completing his deliveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/7fb7fd44053eb878f0a2f55c583d08a4.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/187eb06bfced2ea7661c1c96a456a756.poster.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/187eb06bfced2ea7661c1c96a456a756.webm?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/187eb06bfced2ea7661c1c96a456a756.mp4?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must carefully navigate and strategize to face or avoid <strong>powerful bosses</strong> and <strong>minibosses</strong>. One wrong move can trigger dangerous foes, testing your reflexes and tactical skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/42fc8e7b7d0d7dfcb5d985e4b0b58b67.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/7bc0be07435ade0accd46dc90e67d46b.poster.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/7bc0be07435ade0accd46dc90e67d46b.webm?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/7bc0be07435ade0accd46dc90e67d46b.mp4?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate an interactive <strong>world map</strong> where players can drive Rupert\u2019s vehicle to explore new areas, <strong>unlock missions</strong>, and discover secrets. The map is inspired by a similar system seen in <strong>Cuphead</strong> game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/668398e8fcaf116995e3e9d1a3d42c7a.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/98a6e2e86ebc92e33cbde3f500056a6c.poster.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/98a6e2e86ebc92e33cbde3f500056a6c.webm?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/98a6e2e86ebc92e33cbde3f500056a6c.mp4?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access the map, <strong>upgrade your vehicle</strong>, and make crucial calls to characters like your <strong>boss</strong>. This <strong>handy device</strong> is your all-in-one tool for survival and <strong>strategic planning</strong> in the post-apocalyptic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/bc2142da38babdf186cff5b258673186.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/6deedfbec5301679600c9815fac29f5d.poster.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/6deedfbec5301679600c9815fac29f5d.webm?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/6deedfbec5301679600c9815fac29f5d.mp4?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch your step!</strong> Rupert\u2019s journey is full of danger, where one wrong move can lead to death. From delivering packages to the devil in <strong>hell</strong> to surviving bizarre, post-apocalyptic landscapes, every location offers unexpected challenges with a touch of <strong>humor</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/a99b67e1ddc0901ff92095899e380167.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=260 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3408450?t=1734605296","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3408450?t=1734605296","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset