team/apps/3408450/extras/9b71ef05ff5d767a53897e4bafd8fc27.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/9e0f2f896d4091395b1e26774cbbae07.poster.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/9e0f2f896d4091395b1e26774cbbae07.webm?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/9e0f2f896d4091395b1e26774cbbae07.mp4?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rupert</strong> uses <strong>switches</strong> and <strong>mechanisms</strong> to solve puzzles, <strong>activate traps</strong>, and clear obstacles along his path. Every interaction brings him closer to completing his deliveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/7fb7fd44053eb878f0a2f55c583d08a4.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/187eb06bfced2ea7661c1c96a456a756.poster.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/187eb06bfced2ea7661c1c96a456a756.webm?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/187eb06bfced2ea7661c1c96a456a756.mp4?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must carefully navigate and strategize to face or avoid <strong>powerful bosses</strong> and <strong>minibosses</strong>. One wrong move can trigger dangerous foes, testing your reflexes and tactical skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/42fc8e7b7d0d7dfcb5d985e4b0b58b67.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/7bc0be07435ade0accd46dc90e67d46b.poster.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/7bc0be07435ade0accd46dc90e67d46b.webm?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/7bc0be07435ade0accd46dc90e67d46b.mp4?t=1734605296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate an interactive <strong>world map</strong> where players can drive Rupert\u2019s vehicle to explore new areas, <strong>unlock missions</strong>, and discover secrets. The map is inspired by a similar system seen in <strong>Cuphead</strong> game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/668398e8fcaf116995e3e9d1a3d42c7a.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408450/extras/98a6e2e86ebc92e33cbde3f500056a6c.poster.avif?t=1734605296\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\